<title>USA: Artra Group Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Artra Group Inc Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHFIELD, Ill. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.04     loss	$ 1.22</p>
<p> Net profit		   355     loss	 8,237</p>
<p> Revs			29,397		   29,952</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,949		    6,730</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q3 net loss includes loss from discontinued operations of $1.4 million or $0.20 a share.  </p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 1.55     loss	$ 1.97</p>
<p> Net profit		12,187     loss	13,254</p>
<p> Revs			90,192		   90,703</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,870		    6,712</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine months net profit includes credit from discharge of debt of $9.4 million or $1.23 a share.</p>
<p>1995 nine months net loss includes loss from discontinued operations of $9.2 million or $1.36 a share and credit from discharge of debt of $9.1 million or $1.35 a share.</p>
<p>	   Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
